cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Competitive Binding Assay Analysis Suite"
abstract: >
  A guided Shiny application for analysing receptor binding
  assay (RBA) and ELISA plate reader data. Produces reproducible
  4-parameter logistic dose-response fits, quantified sample
  concentrations with confidence intervals, and bilingual
  (English/Spanish) HTML, Word, or PDF reports.
